    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0075" n="809" xml:id="pg809"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Haentjens.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-21"><hi rendition="#italic">January 21,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 12th instant, setting forth the grounds upon which your
                    Government acted in expelling the American citizen, Eugene Wiener.</p>
                <p>I have transmitted to oar minister at Port au Prince a copy, explaining that its
                    statements had been verified by evidence submitted by you to this Department,
                    and instructing him to refrain from remonstrance against the expulsion of Mr.
                    Wiener.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
